</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove lower part of rear door hinge reinforcement and lower part of center pillar inner panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0092.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "68.149mm" ver = "02" gw = "213" gh = "177"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
