[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle outside
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENKSB0A9B06013003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body outside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A9B04006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body inside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A9B04007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Roof side reinforcement is removed from center pillar reinforcement.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install 2 rear door hinge retainers and door striker retainer.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0146.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "102.661mm" ver = "01" gw = "355" gh = "274"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install lower part of rear door hinge reinforcement and lower part of center pillar inner panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0093.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "72.478mm" ver = "02" gw = "213" gh = "189"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle outside
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install upper part of rear door hinge reinforcement and lower part of center pillar inner panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0094.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "58.946mm" ver = "02" gw = "471" gh = "151"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
